  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">B2B Nile Agro and Danish Technological Institute (DTI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the partnership is to deliver training and technical assistance from the DTI to NAIL in order to achieve transformation in management practices and improve production as well as the working environment at the edible oil production facilities. The partners are upgrading the different environmental issues at the factory, as well as train the staff on different aspects of production.</narrative>
  </description>
